 medium-wide tracking shot follows <Subject 1>, the elegant woman from <Picture 1> with dark hair in a neat low bun, wearing a tailored black blazer with satin lapels, black shorts, black high-heeled ankle boots, and gold geometric earrings, as she walks steadily along the red carpet under the night sky. Bright event spotlights illuminate her and the carpet, while the surrounding plaza falls into dramatic shadow. The camera moves laterally alongside her at walking pace, keeping her centered in frame. On both sides, photographers and fans line the velvet ropes, cameras flashing continuously in the darkness. <Subject 1> turns her head to smile and wave gracefully to her left, then to her right, acknowledging the crowd with a warm, composed expression. Her gold earrings glint with each flash. At 00:04.500, she approaches a large white signature wall adorned with glowing sponsor logos and bright event backlighting that makes it stand out vividly against the night. She slows her pace, pauses briefly in front of the wall, and offers one more sweeping wave to both sides of the crowd before turning her attention forward. At 00:07.500, she steps off the end of the red carpet onto a set of wide, illuminated stairs leading up to a large elevated stage with a sleek modern design and dramatic uplighting along its edges. She ascends the stairs with measured, confident steps, her black ankle boots clicking softly against each step, the camera angle shifting slightly upward to follow her ascent. At 00:10.000, she reaches the stage platform and walks toward an elegant black velvet chair positioned center-stage under a soft spotlight. She turns, lowers herself smoothly into the seat, crosses her legs, and rests her hands lightly on her lap. From 00:11.000 onward, the camera begins a slow, continuous push-in, gradually tightening from a medium shot to a close-up of her face as she settles into the chair, her expression calm and poised, looking slightly off-camera as if awaiting the event to begin. The shot ends on a tight close-up of her face, softly lit by the stage spotlight against the dark background.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nContinuous rapid camera shutters fire from both sides of the red carpet, their clicks echoing slightly in the open night air. The crowd's excited murmurs and occasional cheers rise and fall. High heels click rhythmically against the carpet, then transition to a harder, more resonant sound on the stage stairs. The velvet chair emits a soft creak as she sits down. Stage ambient hum and faint equipment noise become audible toward the end as the camera pushes in.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nThe cinematic orchestral score continues seamlessly from the previous segment, with strings maintaining a warm, sustained pad. A gentle harp arpeggio pattern enters at 00:04.500 as she approaches the signature wall, adding sparkle and elegance. A subtle brass swell begins at 00:07.500 as she ascends the stage, conveying grandeur and anticipation. The music then settles into a calmer, more intimate texture with solo piano and muted strings as the camera pushes in for the close-up, ending on a soft, unresolved chord."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 36, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [15], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [381.22283935546875, 82], "pos": [1159.398193359375, 388.96826171875], "widgets_values": ["minimax_h3_fl2v_lightx2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfy.safetensors", 0.7500000000000001], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 3, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "type": "FL