ts into a third pose, turning to face forward again, extending her right arm outward in an elegant gesture while keeping her left hand on her hip, her gold geometric earrings catching the spotlight glare. She holds this final pose with poise as the shot ends.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe heavy luxury car side door closes with a solid, muffled thud that echoes slightly in the open plaza. Dozens of camera shutters click and flash in rapid, overlapping bursts throughout the video, creating a dense staccato rhythm. A murmur of excited crowd chatter rises from both sides of the red carpet, punctuated by occasional cheers. The soft but distinct sound of high heels clicking against the carpet underlay is audible as she shifts between poses. A faint breeze rustles the velvet ropes.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nAn elegant, cinematic orchestral score at a moderate tempo, featuring sustained strings, a deep cello bass line, sparse piano chords, and a subtle electronic pulse underneath. The music conveys glamour, sophistication, and nighttime event energy, building subtly in volume and intensity as the posing sequence progresses."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 34, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "video_url", "label": "video_url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "video_url"}, {"name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}], "size": [547.2000122070312, 796.0380859375], "pos": [3872.09912109375, 1373.9349365234375], "widgets_values": ["video/MiniMax_H3", "auto", "auto"], "inputs": [{"name": "video", "link": 42, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "视频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "f